        warning: "In `Λ = (ℤ/p^μ ℤ)[Y]/(chosenF)`, `decodeCount_natCast` wraps modulo `p^μ` when `n ≥ p^μ`, and Lagrange denominator differences `a - b` fail to be units whenever `a ≡ b (mod p)` (e.g., `4 - 1 = 3` has no inverse in `ℤ/9ℤ`)!",
