      secondaryDetail: "Slide t_B.y from 4 (curl = −2, 2-cycles = +1,+1,+1) down to 2 (curl = 0) to watch the discrete 1-cocycle vortex vanish and Bellman–Ford prices (0, 3, 1) lock into truthfulness!",
      verdict: truthfulExists
